    "text": "<p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p>\r\r<p>and&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></math> is equal to</p>\r"
  },
